    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d810">

                <pb facs="0827" n="821" sameAs="frus:frus1942v02/pg821"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">868.2222/10</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Greek Ambassador
                        (Diamantopoulos)</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-12-12">December 12,
                        1942</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: I have the honor to refer to my
                    note of October 30, 1942,<anchor n="95" xml:id="d810-f1"/> regarding the
                    formation of separate battalions of Greek subjects in the Army of the United
                    States.</p>
                <p>There is quoted below the text of a communication on this subject which has been
                    received from the War Department: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“The War Department is initiating action to form an Infantry Battalion
                            with Greek Nationals at an early date. Announcement of <pb facs="0828"
                                n="822" xml:id="pg822"/> this action will be made to the public at
                            the Secretary of War’s next press conference.”<anchor n="96"
                                xml:id="d810-f2"/>
                        </p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <p>Accept [etc.]</p>
                <closer>For the Secretary of State: <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sumner Welles</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d810-f1" n="95" xml:id="d810-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d810-f2" n="96" xml:id="d810-f2-content">
                <p>Announcement was made by the War Department on December 12, 1942.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
